The change makes the bot heal to 95% instead of 85% before leaving spawn, but only while no enemy is within 6 tiles, so it still leaves to fight when threatened.

```python
@gene('Z67b', 'true while I stand on my spawn, healing up to 95% health, unless enemies are close enough to fight', parents=['Z67a'])
