This mutation changes `healing()` so the bot stays on spawn to top up to 95% health when no enemy champion is visible, instead of stopping at 80%. Both linked genes, `cast_value` and `progress`, read `healing()` unchanged. The `enemies()` call adds some fuel cost, but it only runs while the bot is on spawn.

