This mutation changes `goal_field` so a champion below 60% health retreats toward spawn when enemies are within 6 tiles, instead of only below 35%. `progress` and `score` are unchanged, so the `progress -> goal_field` and `score -> progress` links keep their current behaviour apart from the new retreat trigger.

